Title: Sample Scene
Author: AllastorV

INT. OLD APARTMENT - HALLWAY - NIGHT

A dim corridor. A damp poster curls away from the wall. The bulb flickers.

MAYA
(whispering)
Are you sure nobody's here?

LEO
No. I've never been sure.

Maya approaches the door. She reaches for the handle, then stops.

EXT. STREET - NIGHT

Rain begins. A streetlight spills across the wet pavement.

CUT TO:
